# Every file a binary embeds (//go:embed) is checked out exactly as it is
# stored, never converted: a Windows checkout with autocrlf would otherwise
# build a binary that carries other bytes than every other build's.
# cmd/reminal's TestEveryEmbeddedFileIsCheckedOutAsStored holds each embed to
# a line here.
#
# The viewer's sources are served, hashed and SRI-pinned exactly as they are
# in the repository.
internal/client/web/** -text
# The pi extension reminal writes for pi, and fingerprints against the copy it
# carries (internal/piext).
internal/piext/extension/** -text
# libghostty-vt built for wasm32, embedded by internal/vtwasm and checked
# against its recorded sha256.
internal/vtwasm/ghostty-vt.wasm -text
